{'symbol': 'CHTR', 'date': '2021-04-22 17:08:00', 'title': 'CHARTER CLOSES $1.0 BILLION SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN., APRIL 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHARTER COMMUNICATIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: CHTR) (ALONG\xa0WITH ITS SUBSIDIARIES, "CHARTER") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARIES, CCO HOLDINGS, LLC AND CCO HOLDINGS CAPITAL CORP., HAVE CLOSED ON $1.0 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2033 (THE "NOTES").'}